author=E3N
description=Capability-probed vendor ThermalLevelMap XML / FPS property for pudding; no ROM/SDK allowlist. Source hash pinned per install and checked at boot; OTA XML changes fail closed. Preserves thermal HAL and CPU/GPU/battery safeguards.

